    },
    {
      "en": "Our growth has stalled. Start with a decision card on deepening the core business, changing channels, or testing a second curve, and wait for my confirmation before creating a team.",
      "zh": "公司增长停滞了，请先形成决策起手卡，比较深挖主业、变革渠道和小试第二曲线；在我确认前不要建团。"
